      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After Netossa and Spinnerella have to pull out at the last minute in taking part in Angellaâ€™s Nativity play at the local community centre, Catra and Adora are dragged in to be the replacement Mary and Josephine. The couple havenâ€™t had the best relationship with religion in their livesâ€¦ but maybe making a few kids and families happy will more than make up for that. (Catradora, Modern AU, Fluff)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
